# =============================================================================
# 11_VkInstance — Git 忽略规则
# 源码、CMake、GLSL、资源模型提交；构建产物与运行目录不提交
# =============================================================================

# --- CMake Preset 统一构建目录 ---
build/
build_test/
out/
run/

# --- 子目录内误生成的 CMake/MSBuild 残留（勿在子项目根单独 cmake -B build）---
**/CMakeCache.txt
**/CMakeFiles/
**/cmake_install.cmake
**/CTestTestfile.cmake
**/DartConfiguration.tcl
**/Testing/

# --- 可执行文件与动态库 ---
*.exe
*.dll
*.pdb

# --- 编译中间产物（*.obj 排除 resources/ 下的 Wavefront 网格）---
*.obj
!**/resources/**/*.obj
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.ilk
*.exp
*.idb
*.ipch
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.recipe

# --- 静态库（仅出现在 out/，显式忽略以防散落）---
*.lib

# --- SPIR-V（由 glslc 构建；只提交 .vert/.frag/.comp/.glsl 源）---
*.spv

# --- Visual Studio / MSVC 本地状态 ---
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.sdf
*.opensdf
*.VC.db
*.VC.VC.opendb
*.opendb

# --- 工具链生成 / 日志 / 临时文本 ---
compile_commands.json
*.log
*.tmp
*.cache
err.txt
log.txt

# --- IDE 本地（不提交；.vscode/tasks.json、launch.json 需提交）---
.cursor/

# --- Nanite 独立构建产物（保留 .sln / .vcxproj / GLSL 源）---
Vulkan_NaniteInUE5.5.4/NaniteVulkan.exe
